{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"bea77b3aa8606183f08cbaa709603ba84ae30b99f74b64833a8395fda13ccb3b","ja":"突然の告白！？","zh":"突然的告白！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b993cd12793e8b67ad72395ef9bd82779b58cb5cc15b757540c3086ee2a559af","ja":"「それで、何の用かな？」","zh":"“那么，有什么事吗？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e528c4286a368d171f0b01606011a362ddd07b18bdbd9f61e0c00a077ad98816","ja":"「え、え～っと……\nじゃ、じゃあ、聞いてくれる？」","zh":"「那、那个……\n那、那你能听我说吗？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"51793d5c94a7a7159affe72f7d4ea4e9444ffd292f6c2949d24220b481c0eecc","ja":"（あれ？　ふたりとも、真剣な顔して\n何を話してるのかナ……？）","zh":"（咦？两个人一脸严肃，\n是在聊什么呢……？）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"97bb0821ce9a0f36fd3b36c74699b02dc052062c596e4afe534cc267c58567fb","ja":"「……あなたのことが、ずっと前から好きでしたっ！\nアタシの恋人になってください！」","zh":"“……我很久以前就喜欢你了！\n请做我的恋人吧！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1d6bff100da1dab2b41d72d22949d3a36a576b74c920ed3cf64f3683ce709423","ja":"えっ……ええーっ！　メグミとカナ、\nいつの間にそんな関係になったノ～！？","zh":"诶……诶诶——！惠和可奈，\n什么时候变成那种关系了的～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"30964c1b88257f29055b861ffc7e08a2e651079324d1674531f42acc051c2588","ja":"エ、エレナさん！？　ご、誤解です！\n今のはそういうのじゃなくてですね！","zh":"艾、艾蕾娜小姐！？误、误会啊！\n刚才那个不是那样的啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"04bdd58ed457c676009c614621ec4b0a1a4e1aeb0c30f675d09123392338a555","ja":"恵美さんには、ちょっと私のお手伝いを\nしてもらっていただけなんです！","zh":"我只是让惠美帮了我\n一点忙而已啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"855e4484c830f1f68302a33369ed4ea2487a634cc61950aac1e293470eebb1d3","ja":"お手伝い？\n告白するお手伝いって、どういうこと？","zh":"帮忙？\n帮忙告白，是什么意思啊？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"8cbddbe17036605ce160575499af86799eb6d36e224ff43ba2579d80ff7136c0","ja":"実は……学校の友達から「告白したい男子がいるから\n練習に付き合ってほしい」って言われちゃって。","zh":"其实……学校的朋友跟我说“我有想要告白的男生，\n希望你能陪我练习一下”。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"12fa4456b6c040357c61526b9de67c733f52f2c8c7fcf85208b3d87282557f40","ja":"それで、ちゃんとその人をマネして演じられるように、\n演技の練習に付き合ってもらってたんです。","zh":"所以，为了能够好好模仿那个人并演出来，\n才请人陪着一起练习演技的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"c507d6565f4142ea7118506a335f59a03fc8bb36bcac44d3ab448b7556621f8c","ja":"そゆこと！　アタシが友達役で、\n可奈が告白相手の役ね♪","zh":"就是这么回事！我来演朋友，\n可奈演告白的对象哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"eecce1e61c77b25cafa87e2370589ee12547de29279e5871ae0a467ba303a0ac","ja":"そうだったノ？\nも～、ビックリしちゃったヨ～。","zh":"是那样吗？\n真是的～，吓了我一跳啦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"2eec71a54927febd7e33a0cfbb3d4078d6865cf6f53aa10c5e123cd706d6db56","ja":"でも、なんか楽しそう♪\nねえねえ、ワタシもその練習、見てていい？","zh":"不过，好像挺有意思的♪\n呐呐，我也能在旁边看你们练习吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"cd949a3a33229d802cb19773f143bf83b39eac97f0ff0d10bfa118fc3f94d53e","ja":"ワタシもなにか、\nアドバイスできるかもしれないヨ～。","zh":"我也许也能给你\n提点什么建议哦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1460.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ad57c99975a0a2bb7de172e782bc81b8ef0b1feb6d86cb4d65979d6392e85fd4","ja":"いいんですか？　ありがとうございます！\nぜひぜひアドバイス、お願いしま～す♪","zh":"真的可以吗？太感谢了！\n请务必要给我建议哦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
